01:30.650 --> 01:32.640
The ball's now in front of the opposite goal!

01:32.640 --> 01:35.090
Italy's going for a counterattack!

01:35.090 --> 01:38.460
But Soda and Jito are upfield, leaving only Ishizaki and Matsuyama to defend!

01:38.460 --> 01:40.140
The goal is vulnerable!

01:43.860 --> 01:45.060
Damn it!

01:46.220 --> 01:47.570
This one's mine!

01:48.260 --> 01:52.330
With lightning speed, Italy scores the first goal!

01:53.390 --> 01:57.220
They got us. The Italians really <i>are</i> strong.

01:57.220 --> 01:58.410
Misaki.

01:58.410 --> 01:59.380
Yes, sir!

02:01.290 --> 02:04.210
It's been three years since we played together in Japan...

02:04.740 --> 02:09.300
I've been really worried that I might drag the team down.

02:10.310 --> 02:10.980
But...

02:11.860 --> 02:13.260
In the end, I...

02:13.260 --> 02:16.660
I just wanna play soccer with everyone!

02:17.330 --> 02:19.660
And win!

02:19.660 --> 02:21.870
Oh! The Japanese are doing a player change.

02:21.870 --> 02:25.920
Number 11, Misaki Taro, replaces Tachibana Kazuo.

02:25.920 --> 02:30.090
Will Misaki's entrance turn around the game?

02:33.700 --> 02:36.700
Sign: Let's form our duo on the Japanese national team someday - Ohzora Tsubasa

02:34.360 --> 02:36.700
I've been in France for three years.

02:36.700 --> 02:39.490
And I've never been on a club team before.

02:39.490 --> 02:44.220
So I was worried I wouldn't be good enough for the Japanese national team.

02:48.730 --> 02:50.500
Misaki-kun!

02:50.930 --> 02:55.500
Tsubasa-kun, guys, I'm gonna give it my all!

02:59.110 --> 03:01.410
And the game resumes!

03:04.100 --> 03:05.980
All right, we're on!

03:16.420 --> 03:21.620
<b>Italy's "God of Defense"</b>

03:16.420 --> 03:21.620
<b>Italy's "God of Defense"</b>

03:21.620 --> 03:24.580
International Stadium of Paris

03:26.150 --> 03:30.580
Number 11, Misaki, is sprinting upfield for an attack on the left.

03:32.230 --> 03:34.620
Like we'd let a sub get past us!

03:40.380 --> 03:41.460
He's through!

03:41.460 --> 03:43.850
Misaki got past Conti!

03:43.850 --> 03:46.460
He dodges his second opponent brilliantly!

03:46.460 --> 03:47.950
Fascinating!

03:47.950 --> 03:51.460
So number 10 wasn't the only good player Japan had.

03:51.460 --> 03:54.480
Whoa, he's good! Who is he?

03:54.480 --> 03:56.560
His name is Taro Misaki.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.620
Huh?

04:07.970 --> 04:08.580
Tsubasa-kun!

04:10.150 --> 04:13.100
Tsubasa traps the ball and heads straight for the Italian goal!

04:13.100 --> 04:15.740
Go! Nankatsu Golden Duo!

04:15.740 --> 04:17.140
Go for it, Tsubasa!

04:17.140 --> 04:18.060
Tsubasa-kun!

04:18.060 --> 04:19.770
Excellent passing!

04:19.770 --> 04:26.220
Here in France, we're witnessing the reunion of the Nankatsu Golden Duo on the Japanese national team!

04:28.840 --> 04:31.780
Impressive! Their rhythm is perfect!

04:31.780 --> 04:33.050
Of course it is.

04:33.050 --> 04:38.020
A three year separation is nothing to the <i>real</i> Golden Duo.

04:38.020 --> 04:40.370
They're both heading straight for the Italian goal!

04:40.370 --> 04:42.700
But a huge wall's standing in front of them!

04:43.450 --> 04:48.700
And protecting the Italian goal is, yet again, Perfect Keeper Hernandez!

04:48.700 --> 04:51.520
Go! Go, Tsubasa and Misaki!

04:51.520 --> 04:52.660
We're counting on you, Tsubasa!

04:52.660 --> 04:53.860
That's the way, Misaki!

04:54.520 --> 04:56.660
Mark both of them!

04:56.660 --> 04:59.860
Yeah! Leave it to us!

05:00.460 --> 05:03.580
Is this as far as they can get against the legendary Italians?

05:05.580 --> 05:07.820
We've come this far!

05:08.250 --> 05:09.780
We will...

05:09.780 --> 05:11.550
put up a fight!

05:23.530 --> 05:24.680
He got through!

05:24.680 --> 05:27.740
Misaki broke through the Italian defense!

05:27.740 --> 05:29.820
Hernandez runs toward him!

05:31.190 --> 05:32.880
Misaki prepares to shoot!

05:33.850 --> 05:35.270
Oh, he passed!

05:35.270 --> 05:37.540
Misaki passed to Tsubasa!

05:37.540 --> 05:40.340
And Tsubasa's jumping up!

05:41.240 --> 05:43.460
He's going for the overhead kick!

05:43.740 --> 05:44.620
What's this?!

05:44.620 --> 05:47.580
Tsubasa passes the ball while still in mid-air!

05:48.560 --> 05:50.130
Misaki jumps in for a diving header!

05:50.130 --> 05:53.170
Misaki goes for the goal! No, he doesn't!

05:53.170 --> 05:55.420
He passes again!

05:57.420 --> 05:59.380
They did it!

05:58.160 --> 06:01.180
It's in! It's a goal!

06:01.650 --> 06:09.420
The Japanese Golden Duo fooled Perfect Keeper Hernandez and tied the score with a diving header!

06:09.740 --> 06:11.900
Suddenly, it's 1-1!

06:11.900 --> 06:14.340
That's some great combination play!

06:14.340 --> 06:17.580
Maybe. But they're not playing against us.

06:18.790 --> 06:21.050
Now the flow of the game has changed.

06:21.050 --> 06:21.800
Yes, sir!

06:21.800 --> 06:24.020
If Hernandez is the "Perfect Keeper", 

06:24.020 --> 06:28.050
that makes Tsubasa and Misaki's shot just now "perfect", too.

06:29.150 --> 06:31.380
Let's go with the 4-5-1 formation.

06:31.380 --> 06:37.120
With Tardelli as the forward, we'll strengthen the midfield and pressure those two early

06:37.120 --> 06:39.050
using swift counterattacks to win the game.

06:39.050 --> 06:39.730
Got it?!

06:39.730 --> 06:41.100
Yes, sir!

06:41.100 --> 06:45.100
The game resumes with Italy kicking off.

06:51.900 --> 06:53.380
Nice one, Takeshi!

06:53.380 --> 06:56.540
If Tsubasa-san and Misaki-san are the Nankatsu Golden Duo,

06:56.540 --> 06:59.470
me and Hyuga-san are the <i>Toho</i> Golden Duo!

06:59.470 --> 07:00.620
Hyuga-san!

07:01.580 --> 07:03.180
Here I go!

07:03.180 --> 07:06.160
They made the midfield stronger to protect the tie, huh?

07:06.160 --> 07:08.460
We'll still win!

07:09.740 --> 07:10.980
Hyuga-kun!

07:13.340 --> 07:17.100
Tsubasa gets double-teamed and can't pass to Hyuga!

07:17.100 --> 07:19.410
They're marking Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun...

07:19.410 --> 07:23.790
They're not marking me as much, so I'm bound to get a chance!

07:23.790 --> 07:25.780
When that time comes, I'll score!

07:25.780 --> 07:29.060
Damn! We won't be able to score at this rate!

07:29.060 --> 07:30.860
Should we go upfield, too?

07:30.860 --> 07:35.500
Wait! If we're impatient, what happened in the first half will just happen again!

07:35.500 --> 07:37.200
Matsuyama!

07:37.200 --> 07:40.300
We can't let them break the tie by scoring on us!

07:42.340 --> 07:45.340
They have to watch out for Italy's sudden counterattacks!

07:45.340 --> 07:46.860
They won't let it go like that!

07:46.860 --> 07:48.340
Go, Japan!

07:48.340 --> 07:50.670
There are only three minutes left now!

07:50.670 --> 07:53.340
Will this game end without either team scoring again?

07:53.340 --> 07:55.090
It doesn't matter who wins.

07:55.090 --> 08:00.020
We Argentineans will be the ones going to the quarterfinals.

08:01.500 --> 08:05.300
Oh! Tsubasa intercepts and dribbles upfield!

08:05.300 --> 08:08.500
We won't let things end like this!

08:10.440 --> 08:11.880
And he centers the ball!

08:11.880 --> 08:15.010
Misaki runs into the pass, jumps, and does a volley shot!

08:15.010 --> 08:16.700
But Hernandez catches it!

08:17.800 --> 08:19.420
All right! Counterattack!

08:20.170 --> 08:22.870
A counterattack! Watch out, Japan!

08:25.990 --> 08:28.120
You were right about being patient, Matsuyama!

08:28.390 --> 08:31.350
Wait until we've successfully defended our goal to say that.

08:31.350 --> 08:35.450
Let's make them pay for the way they humiliated us in the friendly game!

08:35.450 --> 08:37.540
We're counting on you, Wakashimazu!

08:38.020 --> 08:39.300
All right!

08:43.700 --> 08:47.010
We need one more! We still have a chance!

08:47.010 --> 08:49.900
Wakashimazu clears the ball! It's still in play!

08:51.350 --> 08:52.580
Let's win this game!

08:53.020 --> 08:53.900
Yeah!

08:54.900 --> 08:56.350
Let's do this, Misaki-kun!

08:56.350 --> 08:56.900
Understood!

08:59.380 --> 09:01.420
Wow, he's fast!

09:01.420 --> 09:03.210
If the Italians play like blue streaks,

09:03.210 --> 09:06.500
the passing game from Tsubasa and Misaki is like a white flash!

09:06.500 --> 09:08.980
Oh! Misaki has been tripped!

09:08.980 --> 09:10.850
But Tsubasa's still headed for the goal!

09:10.850 --> 09:13.540
This is the legendary Italian determination.

09:13.540 --> 09:15.820
That's a foul!

09:15.820 --> 09:18.660
He's deliberately grabbing Tsubasa's uniform!

09:18.660 --> 09:21.260
Hey! Let go of Tsubasa-kun!

09:21.260 --> 09:24.320
Damn it! If I say we'll score a goal, we'll score!

09:24.320 --> 09:25.620
If I say we'll win, we'll win!

09:28.180 --> 09:29.180
He did it!

09:29.180 --> 09:31.770
He left all the defenders in the dust!

09:31.770 --> 09:33.660
Run, Tsubasa! Run!

09:33.660 --> 09:35.180
You're in front of the goal!

09:38.420 --> 09:44.060
Oh! Tsubasa flicks the ball aloft with his heel. The Italian defender can't do anything!

09:44.060 --> 09:46.820
Tsubasa is in position to do an overhead kick!

09:50.050 --> 09:52.290
But it's stopped!

09:52.290 --> 09:55.230
Hernandez repelled Tsubasa's overhead shot!

09:55.230 --> 09:57.140
Has Japan reached their limit?

09:57.140 --> 09:59.850
How can we lose to a novice Japanese team?!

09:59.850 --> 10:03.140
Italy's the kingdom of soccer, and we're its national team!

10:04.140 --> 10:04.900
Huh?

10:04.900 --> 10:06.770
It's not over yet!

10:06.770 --> 10:11.010
I'll keep shooting until we score the winning goal!

10:11.010 --> 10:13.110
Try and stop this, Hernandez!

10:13.540 --> 10:15.260
It's Tsubasa's Bullet Shot!

10:15.720 --> 10:16.740
But it's saved!

10:16.740 --> 10:18.740
Japan has failed to score.

10:18.740 --> 10:21.740
Is the time up now?

10:28.690 --> 10:30.270
It's not over yet!

10:30.270 --> 10:34.510
I'll keep shooting until we score the winning goal!

10:34.510 --> 10:36.430
Try and stop this, Hernandez!

10:37.420 --> 10:39.570
It's Tsubasa's Bullet Shot!

10:39.570 --> 10:40.380
But it's saved!

10:40.380 --> 10:42.380
Japan has failed to score.

10:42.380 --> 10:44.760
Is the time up now?

10:51.740 --> 10:55.060
We're gonna make the Italian national team pay!

10:55.060 --> 11:59.410
I'll crush anyone who makes fun of our way of soccer with my ultimate shot!

11:00.260 --> 11:01.500
Hyuga-kun!

11:02.120 --> 11:04.490
It doesn't matter how much you shoot!

11:05.060 --> 11:06.820
Damn it, my arm...!

11:06.820 --> 11:08.550
I'll stop it!

11:08.550 --> 11:10.780
My arm's not broken yet!

11:13.010 --> 11:18.100
That black ball I got from Coach Kira improved my shooting.

11:18.100 --> 11:20.820
We will... win!

11:21.380 --> 11:22.860
Take this!

11:22.860 --> 11:25.980
This is my Neo Tiger Shot!

11:34.860 --> 11:36.950
Hernandez can't stop it!

11:36.950 --> 11:40.980
Hyuga's shot flew past Hernandez's golden right arm!

11:47.340 --> 11:48.770
Hyuga-kun!

11:48.770 --> 11:50.300
You did it! We won!

11:51.010 --> 11:52.300
Hyuga-san!

11:52.300 --> 11:55.240
Yes! They won!

11:55.240 --> 11:57.340
You're amazing, Hyuga-kun!

11:57.340 --> 12:00.280
This was a magnificent first victory!

12:00.280 --> 12:03.340
Japan's ace striker made the winning shot!

12:03.340 --> 12:07.140
Number 9! Hyuga Kojiro!

12:07.140 --> 12:12.780
And though they may have been beaten, the Italians fought bravely, led by Hernandez!

12:12.780 --> 12:14.510
All right!

12:14.510 --> 12:16.440
We did it, coach!

12:16.440 --> 12:18.580
Yes, everyone did really well!

12:19.570 --> 12:23.400
Japan beat the legendary Italy team.

12:23.400 --> 12:24.590
Okay, let's do this!

12:24.590 --> 12:26.220
It's our turn now!

12:26.220 --> 12:27.180
Yeah!

12:27.720 --> 12:29.860
Japan's not so bad.

12:33.220 --> 12:36.030
Nice shot, Hyuga-kun.

12:36.030 --> 12:36.900
Yeah.

12:36.900 --> 12:39.260
It was an incredible shot.

12:40.600 --> 12:44.140
Tsubasa, while playing against Italy today, I realized something.

12:45.160 --> 12:51.380
In this world, there are tons of people fighting hard in order to "win" or beat someone.

12:53.380 --> 12:59.050
Until now, my goal has only been beating and surpassing you.

12:59.050 --> 12:59.660
But...

12:59.660 --> 13:05.180
Now I've found a goal to aim for that's even <i>higher</i> than you.

13:05.850 --> 13:07.790
With this number 9,

13:07.790 --> 13:10.490
I aim to become the best striker in the world!

13:15.060 --> 13:17.180
Okay, Hyuga-kun!

13:17.180 --> 13:21.260
Let's shock the whole world with our kind of soccer!

13:21.260 --> 13:22.860
Yeah!

13:23.620 --> 13:25.070
But first...

13:25.070 --> 13:28.460
...we have to win this tournament!

13:28.460 --> 13:29.620
YEAH!

13:34.550 --> 13:36.780
Tsubasa... Ohzora...

13:39.010 --> 13:40.700
Excellent job beating us.

13:44.950 --> 13:48.770
Let's play again someday, Hernandez!

13:48.770 --> 13:49.740
Yes!

13:51.570 --> 13:53.660
Hernandez' right hand...

13:53.660 --> 13:57.980
I'm sorry for boycotting the practice game the other day.

13:57.980 --> 13:59.460
It's okay!

14:00.130 --> 14:01.800
See ya. Ciao!

14:01.800 --> 14:03.230
Ciao!

14:03.230 --> 14:04.780
See ya!

14:04.780 --> 14:06.810
Ciao!

14:13.530 --> 14:15.220
Well done, everyone!

14:15.220 --> 14:18.780
Let's go salute all those who supported us!

14:18.780 --> 14:20.070
Yeah!

14:20.070 --> 14:21.610
Let's go, guys!

14:32.580 --> 14:39.120
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai! Banzai! {Banzai!}

15:01.460 --> 15:04.900
The ambiance in France is really something!

15:04.900 --> 15:06.620
Their own team's about to play, after all.

15:06.620 --> 15:10.160
To them, soccer's more than a sport.

15:10.160 --> 15:12.750
The interest just isn't the same in Japan.

15:12.750 --> 15:14.530
Hey, over here!

15:15.490 --> 15:17.300
Tsubasa!

15:18.530 --> 15:21.580
Germany crushed Canada 4-0.

15:21.580 --> 15:25.780
Schneider managed a hat-trick in his first game of the tournament.

15:25.780 --> 15:27.840
Schneider did?

15:27.840 --> 15:29.620
What about Uruguay versus Belgium?

15:29.620 --> 15:32.390
Uruguay won 3-1.

15:32.390 --> 15:35.980
All three goals were scored by the striker, Ramon Victorino.

15:35.980 --> 15:40.370
Whoa! Two hat-tricks in the first games!

15:40.370 --> 15:42.500
We can't let our guard down.

15:42.500 --> 15:45.090
The players are coming out.

15:49.090 --> 15:52.620
Pierre leads the French national team onto the pitch.

16:06.180 --> 16:10.260
It's almost like they're pop stars or superheroes!

16:11.820 --> 16:14.300
As the host, France is favored to be the champion.

16:14.850 --> 16:18.100
And England can't afford to lose either!

16:18.800 --> 16:21.780
And now France is preparing to kick the game off!

16:23.540 --> 16:27.500
The French captain, Pierre, is storming the center with his dribbling!

16:33.660 --> 16:37.680
Amazing! What brilliant dribbling!

16:37.680 --> 16:39.840
He has no unnecessary movements!

16:39.840 --> 16:43.380
He's called an artist of the field.

16:43.380 --> 16:45.290
An artist of the field...?

16:45.290 --> 16:45.920
Yeah.

16:52.180 --> 16:53.970
But Pierre...

16:53.970 --> 16:56.660
I definitely won't lose to you.

16:56.660 --> 16:58.660
None of the English players can keep up with him!

16:59.090 --> 17:01.310
It's basically been Pierre's one-man show!

17:01.310 --> 17:04.370
Is Pierre going to shoot?!

17:04.370 --> 17:08.210
Tsubasa Ohzora and Taro Misaki are watching from the stands.

17:08.210 --> 17:11.460
I shouldn't shoot now.

17:14.580 --> 17:19.310
No, he passes! But the forward, Bourbon, misses his shot!

17:19.310 --> 17:21.740
France lost their chance!

17:21.740 --> 17:23.870
He missed the shot?!

17:23.870 --> 17:24.810
Coach!

17:24.810 --> 17:28.020
Hurry and put me in for that useless player.

17:28.020 --> 17:32.060
Napoléon, you haven't been on this team very long,

17:32.060 --> 17:34.940
so watch and learn from your teammates.

17:34.940 --> 17:37.480
I'm here to play, not to watch!

17:37.480 --> 17:39.780
If I you let me in, I can score a few goals.

17:39.780 --> 17:43.660
So put me in the game!

17:43.660 --> 17:45.140
It's in!

17:45.140 --> 17:49.940
England scores the first goal against France!

17:50.500 --> 17:52.850
Now they're ahead...

17:52.850 --> 17:54.900
Because you didn't put me in yet!

17:54.900 --> 17:56.770
What're you gonna do?

18:00.070 --> 18:01.620
Player change!

18:01.620 --> 18:03.060
You'll replace Bourbon, Napoléon!

18:04.080 --> 18:05.880
That's more like it.

18:05.880 --> 18:08.860
Oh, France is changing players. Napoléon, number 20, enters.

18:11.290 --> 18:14.300
The game resumes with a throw in for England.

18:15.300 --> 18:17.080
Oh! It's been intercepted!

18:17.080 --> 18:21.340
Napoléon, who just entered, steals the ball from England and goes on the attack!

18:22.260 --> 18:23.780
Here I go!

18:26.940 --> 18:29.800
If you wanna win, pass me the ball.

18:29.800 --> 18:31.020
I'll definitely score.

18:33.660 --> 18:36.140
Okay. I will, Napoléon!

18:46.330 --> 18:49.540
Is Pierre going to shoot this time?

18:49.540 --> 18:51.020
Here it comes, Napoléon!

18:51.020 --> 18:51.860
No, he passes!

18:51.860 --> 18:54.610
He passes the ball in front of Napoléon!

18:54.610 --> 18:57.580
Take this! Here's my Cannon Shot!

19:03.160 --> 19:04.580
It's in!

19:04.580 --> 19:10.590
The player who just entered the game, Napoléon, ties the score for France with an amazing shot!

19:19.630 --> 19:21.580
A-Amazing!

19:22.590 --> 19:24.420
What's wrong, Tsubasa?

19:24.420 --> 19:25.620
You're shaking.

19:26.530 --> 19:29.660
It's just amazing how big the world is!

19:29.660 --> 19:33.140
I keep seeing more and more really good players!

19:33.680 --> 19:35.540
We can't let our guard down!

19:36.020 --> 19:37.040
Guys!

19:37.040 --> 19:40.540
It's us against the world! Let's do our best!

19:43.060 --> 19:44.620
Let's go!

19:44.340 --> 19:45.450
Yeah!

19:45.450 --> 19:46.170
Go! Go!

19:46.170 --> 19:46.690
Pass it!

19:46.340 --> 19:49.620
São Paulo - Brazil

19:46.690 --> 19:47.490
Good going!

19:47.960 --> 19:48.730
Pass!

19:49.410 --> 19:50.210
Go for it!

19:50.730 --> 19:51.160
Yeah!

19:52.700 --> 19:54.450
Don't look at the ground!

19:54.450 --> 19:55.580
Look in front of you!

19:55.580 --> 19:56.740
Lift your heads!

19:57.990 --> 20:03.260
Roberto! It's time for the results of the Junior Youth Soccer Championship!

20:03.260 --> 20:06.220
Okay. Let's take a 30-minute break then!

20:11.770 --> 20:17.310
Right now, Uruguay and Germany are the top seeds, with two wins.

20:17.310 --> 20:20.880
In group C, it'll be either France or England.

20:20.880 --> 20:22.060
I wonder who it'll be!

20:22.770 --> 20:25.100
Oh! Japan's hanging in there, too!

20:25.100 --> 20:28.240
That Tsubasa Ohzora's pretty good!

20:28.240 --> 20:29.100
Yeah, he is!

20:29.100 --> 20:31.140
Guys! It's starting!

20:34.020 --> 20:36.500
It's the second day of the Junior Youth Soccer Championship!

20:36.510 --> 20:41.720
Argentina crushed their opponent Italy, 5-0!

20:41.720 --> 20:44.540
5-0?! Whoa!

20:45.720 --> 20:49.820
Thanks to some amazing shots from their genius player, Juan Diaz,

20:49.820 --> 20:53.020
Argentina took the game with an impressive score of 5-0.

20:53.880 --> 21:00.810
Perfect Keeper Hernandez was injured in the Italy - Japan game, and couldn't play.

21:01.540 --> 21:06.450
It's really a shame the Italian goalkeeper, Hernandez, couldn't play.

21:06.450 --> 21:09.950
But on the other hand, I'm looking forward to taking on Japan's number 10,

21:09.950 --> 21:12.820
Tsubasa Ohzora, in tomorrow's game.

21:13.370 --> 21:15.020
You're feeling confident?

21:15.020 --> 21:18.760
Of course. I'll beat Japan and Tsubasa.

21:31.760 --> 21:33.530
Tsubasa...

21:33.530 --> 21:39.340
Just like I thought, you've reached world-class level...

21:42.570 --> 21:46.820
Players from all over the world have their eyes set on you.

21:47.600 --> 21:49.680
But the world is vast!

21:49.680 --> 21:53.820
There are still <i>lots</i> of players in this world who are better than you.

21:54.630 --> 21:58.340
But, Tsubasa, I'm sure you won't lose to them!

21:59.050 --> 22:02.450
I'm sure you'll just keep getting stronger!

22:04.260 --> 22:10.660
Preview

22:04.890 --> 22:07.860
It's the Junior Youth Soccer Championship quarterfinals!

22:07.860 --> 22:11.740
If Japan ties this game, we won't advance to the semifinals.

22:11.740 --> 22:14.950
Our opponent is Argentina, the champion from South America!

22:14.950 --> 22:20.040
This team has a player with exceptional dribbling and passing skills, Juan Diaz!

22:20.040 --> 22:21.950
I'll definitely defeat you!

22:21.950 --> 22:24.900
We'll be the ones going to the finals of this tournament!

22:24.900 --> 22:26.610
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.780 --> 22:34.220
Genius Juan Diaz

22:26.610 --> 22:27.620
Genius Juan Diaz!

22:27.620 --> 22:28.740
Look forward to it!

22:28.740 --> 22:32.060
Let's aim for tomorrow! Goal!

22:34.660 --> 22:38.500
tsumiageru jibun no takasa wa

22:34.660 --> 22:38.500
My skill keeps on growing.

22:38.500 --> 22:42.820
dare ni mo kimerarenai

22:38.500 --> 22:42.820
Nobody can measure it.

22:42.820 --> 22:46.500
komiageru jibun no yowasa wo

22:42.820 --> 22:46.500
The weakness that grows inside me,

22:46.500 --> 22:50.820
dare ni mo miserarenai

22:46.500 --> 22:50.820
I can't let anyone see it.

22:50.820 --> 22:58.780
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

22:50.820 --> 22:58.780
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

22:58.780 --> 23:04.860
aa ima susumu yo

22:58.780 --> 23:04.860
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:10.740 --> 23:14.540
tondekuru koishi wo haratte

23:10.740 --> 23:14.540
I ward off the pebble flying towards me,

23:14.540 --> 23:18.860
bai no hayasa de kaesu

23:14.540 --> 23:18.860
And return it with twice as much speed.

23:18.860 --> 23:22.540
yandeiru kotori wo hirotte

23:18.860 --> 23:22.540
I pick up an ill little bird,

23:22.540 --> 23:26.860
ooki na sora ni kaesu

23:22.540 --> 23:26.860
and return it to the wide open sky.

23:26.860 --> 23:34.820
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

23:26.860 --> 23:34.820
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

23:34.820 --> 23:40.820
aa ima susumu yo

23:34.820 --> 23:40.820
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:46.260 --> 23:50.820
ima daseru subete no chikara de

23:46.260 --> 23:50.820
Using all the strength I have,

23:50.820 --> 23:54.380
koukai wa shitakunai

23:50.820 --> 23:54.380
without feelings of regret...

23:54.380 --> 24:01.820
ima daseru subete no chikara de saikou no kachi

23:54.380 --> 24:01.820
Using all the strength I have, to the ultimate victory.
